Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before changing code, then the `AGENTS.md` in the directory you are working in. They are the source of truth; this file only points to them.

Non-negotiable: money is integer minor units plus a currency code (no floats); policies live in `services/policy/policies/policies.yaml`; submitted expenses are immutable; never hand-edit generated files.
